senses.gloss:
वि-√ भज् P. Ā. -भजति, ˚ते, to divide, distribute, apportion, assign (with two acc., or with acc. of thing and dat. or loc. of pers., or with acc. of pers. and instr. of thing), RV. &c. &c. (Ā. also = ‘to share together or with each other’ or ‘to share with [instr.]’ ; with समम्, to divide into equal parts; with अर्धम् and gen., to divide in halves);
to separate, part, cut, Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to divide (arithmetically), Sūryas.; VarBṛS.;
to open (a box or chest), Kathās.;
to worship, MārkP. :
Pass. -भज्यते, to receive one's share from (instr.), MBh. i, 2344 :
Caus. -भाजयति, to cause to distribute or divide or share, AV.;
to divide, Kathās.; Sūryas. &c.

1. वि-√ भा P. -भाति, to shine or gleam forth, come to light, become visible, appear, RV. &c. &c.;
to shine upon, illumine, RV.; AV.; MBh.;
to procure light i.e. to kindle (fire dat.), RV. i, 71, 6;
to shine brightly, glitter, be resplendent or beautiful, strike or catch the eye, excel by (instr.), RV. &c. &c.;
to strike the ear, be heard (as sound), MBh.;
to seem or appear as, look like (nom. with or without इव, or adv. in -वत्), RV.; &c.

वि-√ भिद् P. Ā. -भिनत्ति, -भिन्त्ते to split or break in two, break in pieces, cleave asunder, divide, separate, open, RV. &c. &c.;
to pierce, sting, ŚBr.; MārkP.;
to loosen, untie, Hariv.; BhP.;
to break, infringe, violate, R.; Bālar.; BhP.;
to scatter, disperse, dispel, destroy, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to alter, change (the mind), MBh.; BhP. :
Pass. to be split or broken, burst asunder &c. (also P. Cond. व्यभेत्स्यत्, ChUp.);
to be changed or altered, R.; BhP. :
Caus. -भेदयति, to cause to split &c.;
to divide, alienate, estrange, MBh.; R.

N. of a brother of Rāvaṇa (his other brothers were Kubera [by a different mother] and Kumbha-karṇa;
both Rāvaṇa and Vibhīṣaṇa are said to have propitiated Brahmā by their penances, so that the god granted them both boons, and the boon chosen by V˚ was that he should never, even in the greatest calamity, stoop to any mean action;
hence he is represented in the Rāmāyaṇa as endeavouring to counteract the malice of his brother Rāvaṇa, in consequence of which he was so ill-treated by him that, leaving Laṅkā, he joined Rāma, by whom, after the death of Rāvaṇa, V˚ was placed on the throne of Laṅkā), MBh.;
Hariv.;
R. &c.

वि-√ भू P. -भवति, to arise, be developed or manifested, expand, appear, RV.; TS.; MuṇḍUp.;
to suffice, be adequate or equal to or a match for (dat. or acc.), ŚBr.;
to pervade, fill, PañcavBr.;
to be able to or capable of (inf.), BhP.;
to exist (in अ-विभवत्, ‘not existing’), KātyŚr.:
Caus. -भावयति, to cause to arise or appear, develop, manifest, reveal, show forth, display, ŚāṅkhBr.; MBh. &c.;
to pretend, feign, Kull. on Mn. viii, 362;
to divide, separate, BhP.;
to perceive distinctly, find out, discover, ascertain, know, acknowledge, recognise as (acc.), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to regard or consider as, take for (two acc.), Kuval.;
to suppose, fancy, imagine, BhP.; Pañcar.;
to think, reflect, Kathās.; Pañcat.;
to suppose anything of or about (loc.), BhP.;
to make clear, establish, prove, decide, Mn.; Yājñ.;
to convict, convince, Yājñ.; Daś. :
Pass. of Caus. -भाव्यते, to be considered or regarded as, appear, seem (nom.), MBh.; Kāv. &c. :
Desid. See -बुभूषा:
Intens. See -बोभुवत्.

वि-√ भूष् P. -भूषति, to be brilliant, appear (?), RV. i, 112, 4 (Sāy. व्याप्तो भवति);
to adorn, decorate, ib. vi, 15, 9 :
Caus. -भूषयति, to adorn, decorate, MBh.; Kāv. &c.

वि-√ भृ P. Ā. -भरति, ˚ते, to spread out, spread asunder, RV.; AV.;
 (Ā.) to distribute, diffuse, ib.; VS.;
to bear, endure, MBh. :
Intens. (only -भ॑रिभ्रत् and -जर्भ्रित॑स्), to move hither and thither or from side to side (as the tongue), RV. ii, 4, 4 : to open the mouth, gape, ib. i, 28, 7.

वि-√ भ्रंश् (sometimes written भ्रंस्) Ā. -भ्रंशते, to fall off (fig.), be unfortunate, fail or be unsuccessful in (loc.), PañcavBr.;
to be separated from, desert (abl.), KātyŚr.:
Caus. -भ्रंशयति, to cause to fall, MBh.;
to strike or break off, R.;
to cause to disappear or vanish, destroy annihilate, BhP.;
to divert from, deprive of (abl.), MBh.; BhP.

वि-√ भ्रम् P. -भ्रमति, -भ्राम्यति, to wander or roam or fly about, roll, hover, whirl, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to reel, quiver, shake, BhP.;
to roam over, wander through (acc.), MBh.;
to fall into disorder or confusion, be disarranged or bewildered, MBh.; Hariv. &c.;
to drive asunder, disperse, scare away, MBh.;
to move about (the tail), R. :
Caus. -भ्रमयति, or -भ्रामयति (Pass. -भ्राम्यते), to confuse, perplex, MārkP.; Hcat.

1. वि-√ भ्राज् Ā. -भ्राजते (ep. also P.), to shine forth, be bright or radiant, RV. &c. &c.;
to shine through (acc.), RV.; AV.;
 Caus. -भ्राजयति, to cause to shine or beam, MBh.; Hariv.; BhP.
